            "review_text": "Lilloh\nKrakow, Poland50 contributions\n0\nScammers assumed\nApr 2025 • Solo\nStop by chance around 23:30, high prices compared to other establishments but the order is taken and received in a few minutes due to the few customers present.\nAround 0:20 asks for the bill, the server asks more than the price shown on the map, it tells me that after midnight the service is 20% more expensive. Indeed it is written at the bottom of the menu that we can hardly distinguish in the darkness. I point out that I placed my order before midnight paying him, he smiles slightly and turns his back on me. Even if it is a derisory amount for a tourist, it is a total lack of respect for people and the profession.\nRead more\nTranslated from French\nShow original\nWritten April 22, 2025",
