            "review_text": "898danielz\n36 contributions\n0\nOverpriced bad food and bad service\nFeb 2020 • Couples\nWe stopped by after very long day out, because it seemed as a very nice restaurant, we immidiately ordered 2 water and 2 beer as we were very thirsty. Grave mistake we were about to find out later on the bill. Water was 60k as was the beer. One would expect such as prices in Vienna aiport, but in that location normal prices are around 10-30k. After we get the menu, waitress was nowhere to find, so I decided to go order food on the bar. Menu looked ok, food was not as overpriced, but then we received it. Small sandwich and seafood noodles with the cheapest instant noodles and few sad pieces of seafood. Then we wanted to pay, so I had to once again go find waitress and kindly ask if we may pay.\nThank, never again. If the owner is wondering why such a nice looking restaurant is always empty, this might be one of the reasons.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 5, 2020",
